        "filing_date": "2026-04-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Building on our international presence, we began exploring more diverse revenue streams in overseas markets in 2024 by offering game distribution, in-game item sales, and marketing services.",
